{"items":[{"key":"article:43941326","id":"43941326","kind":"article","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1709698831763,"text":"2月度过了阿水的生日，感谢每一位来陪她过生日的朋友！2月也度过了春节，狠狠地放假了，希望大家没有假期综合症哦。2月也度过了二阳……这就不用说了喂！月榜感谢（含桃榜+直播守护榜）2月保底生日新衣立牌名单","title":"【2024年2月月榜赞助感谢及保底礼物地址收集】","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":8796,"counts":{"commentCount":20,"likeCount":1760,"bananaCount":8492,"shareCount":0},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/a/ac43941326"},{"key":"article:43999352","id":"43999352","kind":"article","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1710229756979,"text":"嗯也说了这么久了就是说今天我签证差不多了，于是我们时间也定了，4月份准备和@AC娘本体 出发啦。于是我们商讨了一下，如果3月份在@1001Project 直播间真的投喂超过100个猴岛（如果真有这么多","title":"新西兰龙超跳伞活动（赞助征集？）","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":22421,"counts":{"commentCount":185,"likeCount":1580,"bananaCount":7463,"shareCount":20},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/a/ac43999352"}],"media":{"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/newUpload/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/EKvK1y8qOwoFYWNmdW4SBWltYWdlGisxNzk5MjJfZDFmM2U0NTUzODAzNDZhMGJkZDNlYmVjNWIxMjk5NmYucG5n.webp","https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/kimg/EKvK1y8qOwoFYWNmdW4SBWltYWdlGisxNzk5MjJfZDFmM2U0NTUzODAzNDZhMGJkZDNlYmVjNWIxMjk5NmYucG5n.webp"]}},"emotions":{}}